<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Si Inthrathit</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">13th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a> · Also known as Pho Khun Si Inthrathit, Bang Klang Hao</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Si Inthrathit, originally called Bang Klang Hao, was the founder of the Sukhothai Kingdom in present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thailand">Thailand</a>. With his ally <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pha-mueang">Pho Khun Pha Mueang</a> he drove the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khmer-empire">Khmer</a> governor out of Sukhothai in the mid-13th century and became its king, founding the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/phra-ruang-dynasty">Phra Ruang dynasty</a>. His son <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ram-khamhaeng">Ram Khamhaeng</a> extended Sukhothai's influence across much of the region.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/si-inthrathit.jpg" alt="Si Inthrathit" width="320" height="507" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: th:ผู้ใช้:Omogoki · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E0%B8%9E%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%A8%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%A2%E0%B9%8C_%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%84%E0%B8%B8%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B5_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
